{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"ATTESTATION REFRESH SUCCEEDED: 87cb (epic) and b0ac both went mismatch -> sign-review -> CERTIFIED.\nAll seven tickets now hold current plan-review attestations, so no close will be refused on a stale\nmaterial pin. Running those two refreshes in parallel with CI rather than after it saved a serial\n15-20 minute round-trip at close time.\nBlocked now on Verified +1 across patchset 3 only."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788332594723094001,"uuid":"ae9b19b0-7d99-4c46-8213-04d0b8963905"}